        "body": "## What\n\n- stop `location.searchCity` before its Open-Meteo request when `NO_EXTERNAL_CONNECTION=true`\n- show an explicit disabled-outbound-connections state instead of generic missing data in the Weather widget\n- document that both weather data and city search are unavailable in offline mode\n\nThis is the focused `release/v2` port of the still-relevant parts of #6674. The current v2 widget already has centralized loading and failed-query handling, so the stale duplicate UI logic and added test files from that PR were not copied.\n\nCloses #6671.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm vitest run packages/api/src/router/test/location.spec.ts packages/widgets/src/weather/component.spec.ts` (15 passed)\n- `pnpm turbo typecheck --filter=@homarr/api --filter=@homarr/widgets --filter=@homarr/translation`\n- `pnpm turbo build --filter=@homarr/docs`\n- direct `location.searchCity` call with `NO_EXTERNAL_CONNECTION=true` returned `{ \"results\": [] }` without reaching the external request path\n",
